                <modifier field="name" type="set" value="Thundershock"/>
                <modifier field="492d-1f80-b777-26f2" type="set" value="Master-crafted; If you roll a 1 to hit with a plasma weapon it has overheated and injured the model firing it. Make an armor save for the model, otherwise it will suffer a wound. Plasma weapons on vehicles are not affected by overheating."/>
